["Germany is reported to be getting ready to invade England. (: ""
)Philip Murray is the leader of the CIO, a powerful industrial union, in the United States of America. Time runs an article on his union in their January 27 edition. (: ""
)Lord Halifax becomes the British ambassador to the United States of America. On February 10, Life magazine runs an article on him as the new ambassador to America. (: ""
)With Adolf Hitler's Germany in the offensive, Franklin D. Roosevelt presses for more American aid for Great Britain in the United States Congress. (: ""
"]

["A film called The Alamo is released on Earth, starring actors John Wayne, Laurence Harvey, and Richard Widmark. (: "") On Earth Two, the life prolongation project goes disastrously wrong and begins killing off the planet's adult population. (: ""
)

"]

["Jame Finney, the sole child of Benjamin Finney and his wife, is born and is named after James Kirk. (: ""
) Michael Burnham becomes the first officer of the USS Shenzhou under Captain Philippa Georgiou. (: "")


"]

