["The ECS Horizon, an Earth J-class cargo starship, is commissioned. (: "") The Earth survey ship SS Hokule'a is launched for deep space exploration. (: ""
) Soval fires a weapon for the last time until 2152. (: "") Kolos begins serving as an advocate within the Klingon Empire. (: "")

