["The popular film called The Searchers is released on Earth. (: "") Another popular film, The Court Jester, is released on Earth. (: ""; Star Trek Encyclopedia (4th ed., vol. 1, p. 165)
) June - Roy Orbison performs the song "Ooby Dooby". ()

"]

["A group of North American Indians leave Earth in order to preserve their cultural identity and to find a new home. One hundred and eighty years later, they eventually settle on Dorvan V near the Cardassian border. (: ""
) A neutron star in a binary star system located in the Kavis Alpha sector explodes. (: ""
) The Dax symbiont first serves as a field docent for a Trill initiate. (: "")

"]

["Lenore Karidian is born. (: ""
) The first of many thousands of lives lost in the Eminiar-Vendikar War in a star system of Star Cluster NGC 321 is recorded by the United Federation of Planets. After suffering for nearly two decades this mounting loss of life, the Federation would seek permission from the planet Eminiar VII for the construction of a treaty port in their star system in 2267. (: ""
) As he claims, this is the last time before 2267, that Montgomery Scott sees a PXK pergium reactor. (: ""
)
