["2063: Zefram Cochrane makes Earth's first warp flight. Official First Contact between Humans and Vulcans occurs. (; : ""; : "") The population of Levinius V succumbs to mass insanity. (: ""
) The Great Awakening takes place on Argelius II. (: ""
) The Earth colony ship SS Conestoga is launched with the mission of colonizing the planet Terra Nova. (: "") A great Skorr philosopher, Alar, leads his warrior race into a new era of peace. After Alar's death, his thought patterns were preserved in an indurite sculpture referred to as the "Soul of the Skorr." (: "")


"]

["Briam of Krios Prime is born. (: ""
) The starship Horizon visits Sigma Iotia II, a planet that is home to the pre-warp Iotians. One of the starship's crew members accidentally leaves behind a book, Chicago Mobs of the Twenties. The Horizon is lost shortly after leaving the planet, but transmits a radio frequency distress call that is not received by Starfleet until almost a hundred years later. (: ""
)

"]

["Ralph Offenhouse is born on Earth. (: ""
)

"]

["On Acamar III, a blood feud between the Lornak and Tralesta clans begins, which will eventually end two hundred years later with the near extinction of the Tralesta. (: ""
)

"]

["Alfredo Pedillo Jose is born. (: ""
)

"]

["The Setlik III massacre takes place, in which Cardassian forces raid the Federation colony on the planet. (: ""
) Miles O'Brien becomes a transporter chief. (: ""
) Ro Gale is killed during a Cardassian interrogation while his daughter Ro Laren is forced to watch. (: ""
) Dr. Paul Manheim begins a search on a location that meets his criteria for his time and gravity experiments. (: ""
) To keep his son William interested and challenged in anbo-jytsu, Kyle Riker cheats at the martial arts during combat. (: ""
"]

["The Redjac entity, incarnated as "Jack the Ripper", kills eight women at the Martian colonies. (: ""
) The Earth colony ship VK Yuri Gagarin is launched. (: ""
) The Taurean system is briefly explored and a spaceship is lost near there. Over the next 164 years, a ship will disappear in this region exactly every 27.346 years. (: "")

"]

["The Earth ship SS Urusei Yatsura is launched. (: ""
)

"]

["The Earth survey ship SS Hatteras is launched. (: ""
) A starship disappears near the Taurean region. (: "")

"]

["2 February – Devinoni Ral is born in Brussels, European Alliance on Earth. (: ""
) The Son'a subdue the Tarlac and the Ellora and integrate them into their society as a labor class. ()

"]

["Worf, son of Mogh is born on Qo'noS. (: ""
) January 17 – Ro Laren is born on Bajor to Ro Talia and Ro Gale. (: ""
) Nathaniel Teros develops the theory of neuromuscular adaptation for low-gravity species; however, at the time, it has no practical success. (: "") The Yaderans are conquered by the Dominion. (: "") At age five, Will Riker starts school and begins to tell his new friends the same stories about his mother that his father told him. (: ""
"]

["The last passenger pigeon on Earth dies. (: ""
)

