["Revenge of the Creature, a horror/science fiction B-movie, is released. (: "") Miri is born. (: ""
) In the Julian Bashir, Secret Agent holoprogram, Falcon begins a series of attempts to kill Bashir. (: "") The Terran Empire of the mirror universe existed by this year, as a political party or otherwise which eventually turned into an interstellar empire. (: "")

