["A neutron star in a binary star system in the Kavis Alpha sector will continue to explode into the far future every 196 years. (: ""
) The Lactrans estimate that Starfleet will be welcome back to Lactra VII in twenty or thirty Lactran centuries. (: "") The Metrons similarly mused that their civilization may contact the United Federation of Planets in several thousand years. (: ""
)

"]

["The Eugenics Wars continue from the previous year, a terrible conflict on Earth brought about by a group of genetically engineered "supermen" who were the result of an ambitious selective-breeding program. The leader of the group is Khan Noonien Singh and since 1992, he and his followers had seized control in forty Earth nations, which totalled roughly a quarter of the planet. Terrible wars ensue, in part because the "supermen" fought among themselves. Entire populations were bombed out of existence, ferocious battles were being fought and Earth was on the verge of a new Dark Age. (: ""
)

"]

["L. Isao Telaka is born. (: ""
) William Thomas Riker is born in Alaska on Earth. (: ""
, "", "") February 16 – Geordi La Forge is born in Mogadishu, Somalia on Earth. (: ""
) Chakotay, at the age of six, aspires to become a paleontologist. (: "", "") Lore is activated on Omicron Theta. (: ""
)

"]

["Stephen Richey dies on the planet Theta VIII. His remains are discovered by Commander William T. Riker, Lt. Commander Data, and Lt. Worf of the USS Enterprise-D in 2365. (: ""
)

"]

["Liana, the daughter of Ezral and Maya, is born. (: "") The European Hegemony introduces a new distress beacon for starships working for this Earth-based alliance. (: ""
)November 27 - the colony ship SS Mariposa is launched from Earth's Baikonur Cosmodrome on a colonization mission to the Ficus sector. (: ""
)

"]

["Jonathan Archer finishes an eight year tenure as Federation Councilman representing United Earth. (: "") The Earth colony ship DEV Eagle Valley is launched. (: ""
)

"]

["A hive mind or group consciousness is the collective sharing of minds into a single consciousness, serving and driving the goals of its entire population. As such, individuality in a hive mind is sacrificed for the whole, and its members and resources are assigned tasks according to how to best achieve those goals. Hive mind societies encountered by the Federation include: The Body of Landru (: ""
) flying parasites that infested Deneva in 2267 (: ""
) Androids of planet Mudd (: ""
) Borg Collective (: ""
) Cooperative (: "")

"]

["In the script of the Star Trek: Deep Space Nine episode "", Sadera VI is a planet. According to StarTrek.com, Sadera VI orbited the primary Sadera, in a system of the same name. This system was located between Cardassia and Bajor. ; 
In a scene in act two in the script, Natima Lang is thinking of ways to get her students Hogue and Rekelen safely out of the reach of the Cardassian Central Command and thinks about taking them to other Cardassian dissident movement members on Sadera VI. (Star Trek: Deep Space Nine Companion - A Series Guide and Script Library)
"]

["October – Ranger 5 is launched. (: ""
) A rare baseball card of New York Yankees player Roger Maris is printed this year. (: ""
) The Vic Fontaine holoprogram, Bashir 62, on Deep Space 9 is set in this year. (: "") The Big Daddy-O Surf Special luau shirt, an American classic, was introduced. (: "") In the Julian Bashir, Secret Agent holoprogram concerning Doctor Hippocrates Noah is set in this year. (: "")

"]

["2381: According to Geordi La Forge, the Federation will be able to have transporters that are able to successfully work on Tau Cygna V if they started in 2366. (: ""
) 2385: According to Section 31 estimates, the Klingon Empire will have finally recovered from their losses during the Dominion War. (: "") 2387: Romulus is destroyed by an unusually powerful supernova; Spock stops the supernova from growing, but is flung in time to an alternate 2258. ()

"]

["A blood feud erupts between the clans Lornak and Tralesta on Acamar III which will not be resolved for two centuries. (: ""
)

"]

["The false events experienced by Commander William T. Riker while in the illusion created by Barash on Alpha Onias III were said to have occurred in this year. He was said to have taken control of the Enterprise 9 years prior and rescued a Romulan vessel 4 years prior. (: ""
)Two deep-space vessels redirected to USS Voyager six years earlier were expected to rendezvous with Voyager in this year or the one before. (: "")

"]

["According to a speech given by John Gill, the Zeon colony on Ekos was established shortly after this year. (: ""
)

"]

