["John F. Kennedy begins his term as the 35th President of the United States. (: ""
) He later gives his famous "Decision to Go to the Moon" speech. (: "") In 2372, Jake Sisko received a holosuite program from Nog featuring this season's New York Yankees baseball team against the 1978 Boston Red Sox. The outcome of the game was Yankees 7, Red Sox 3. (: "") In 2375, Nog assumed the role of Vic Fontaine's accountant and went over the receipts of 1961. (: "")

"]

["On Earth, television was said to not have lasted as a form of entertainment long beyond this year. (: ""
)
