"]

["Lord Hethrir is a Firrerreo and the Emperor's Procurator of Justice for the Empire, and is found at the Emperor's Retreat on Naboo. /way naboo 2980 -3952 Lord Hethrir;
He is involved in the Imperial Themepark.

"]

["Maximilian Veers is found at the Emperor's Retreat on Naboo, close to Moenia. He is also found in near a Imperial Base close to the Sulfur Lake Pirate Hideout, on Lok. Veers is a Colonel in the Imperial army at the begining timeline of the game and is later encountered as a General the Star Wars Moment Battle of Echo Base. /way naboo 2368 -3921 Maximilian Veers; /way lok -2570 -875 Maximilian Veers;
