["Scolex Grath is a Black Sun associate who can be found in Doaba Guerfel. /way corellia 3349 5489 Scolex Grath;
He's got a doozy of a job lined up if you're interested.

"]

["Grobber can be found in a Coronet Hotel located at the south-west of the Corellian city. /way corellia -455 -4687 Grobber;
This Twi'lek is a member of the Black Sun organization and provides missions to support their operations.

"]

["Booto Lubble is a gungan male who can be found in the Rori Rebel Outpost. /way rori 3701 6488 Booto Lubble;
This gungan operative will speak to you only if you're a Rebel Combatant and will ask you for assistance in a couple tasks.

"]

["The Death Watch Bunker is located on Endor, the nearest starport being the Endor Smuggler Outpost. It is a high-level dungeon filled with members of the Black Sun crime ring recruited by the Death Watch organization. Most NPCs are level 88.To be able to enter the bunker a group member should have spoken with Boba Fett in Jabba’s palace previously to unlock the first security lock-door.The dungeon is very large, and contains crafting rooms where exclusive items may be crafted, such as the Jetpack or the legendary Mandalorian armor.
Waypoint: /way endor -4680 4330 DWB;

"]

["Demitri Firewatcher is found in front of the Keren Theater, on Naboo. /way naboo 1673 2582 Demitri Firewatcher;
Demitri is a herald NPC pointing to the Naboo Pirate Bunker.

"]

["Aaph Koden is a Lieutenant in the Rebel Alliance operating in Anchorhead, Tatooine. /way tatooine 129 -5399 Aaph Koden;
She's giving a few quests to Combatant or Special Forces members of the Rebel faction.

"]

["Brennis Doore is found in Keren, on Naboo. He's what could be called.. a petty crook. /way naboo 1740 2657 Brennis Doore;
Along the tasks he's giving you, you'll realize he's kind of a unique criminal type on a redemption path.

"]

["Tekil Barje lives in the frontier town of Wayfar on Tatooine. /way tatooine -5270 -6566 Tekil Barje;
He has three missions concerning his friend Dagonel "Digger" Dimms and the Tusken Raiders.

"]

